  "title": "Volkswagen and Audi to Build $4bn US Plant Amid Job Cuts and Tariffs",
  "summary": "Volkswagen plans to build its $4bn Audi SUV factory in the US despite job cuts at home, while Audi aims to address tariffs imposed by Trump. The German brand's CEO, Gernot Döllner, attended a Trump rally to announce the factory in Macon, Georgia, in an unusual move.",
  "facts": [
